          "english": "Attention does not, of course, demonstrate a simple causal relation such as “this one word caused the classification as tragedy.” A deep-learning model’s judgment passes through complex computations at multiple levels. Attention scores can nevertheless help us gauge which words and phrases play important roles along the central paths of that judgment.",
